{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1365323-are-the-wan-kuei-still-tied-in-to-exalted-like-they-used-to-be","id":1365323,"title":"Are the Wan Kuei still tied in to Exalted like they used to be?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-02-04T12:17:43-08:00","id":1365323,"title":"Are the Wan Kuei still tied in to Exalted like they used to be?","content":"Or did they get rid of that connection in Third Edition?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-04T12:49:55-08:00","id":1365331,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1365323-are-the-wan-kuei-still-tied-in-to-exalted-like-they-used-to-be#post1365323\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Or did they get rid of that connection in Third Edition?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Honestly, I don't think the connection was ever so strong as to be described as them being &quot;tied in&quot;. Very, very early on in Exalted 1e's development, it was pictured as &quot;the prehistory of the World of Darkness&quot;, but I don't think that conception even survived to the actual publishing of the 1e core book. Exalted used some terminology from Kindred of the East and Wraith: The Oblivion, but it would be unwise to assume that characters or concepts from those game lines were &quot;really&quot; the ones from Exalted, now advanced by millennia or more.<br /> <br /> Certainly, by even 2e times, the whole concept was totally abandoned, and 3e definitely doesn't hold to it at all.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Interested in chatting with other Exalted fans online? Join us on the <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kGsyF5jhdy\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted Discord server</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1533-kelly-pedersen","name":"Kelly Pedersen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1533_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"929"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-04T13:11:49-08:00","id":1365335,"title":"","content":"Thank you! I didn't know that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-04T18:26:44-08:00","id":1365413,"title":"","content":"If you would like to draw a connection, boy dose Holden have something for you!<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://1d4chan.org/wiki/Exalted_Versus_World_of_Darkness#All_the_Other_Exalted\" target=\"_blank\">1d4 Chan (</a><a href=\"https://1d4chan.org/wiki/Kindred_of_the_East\" target=\"_blank\">Wan Xian</a> in Exalted vs World of Darkness, &amp; a part of a larger article that did a great job of summarizing this project)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/posts/exalted-vs-world-23661124\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted vs The Wold of Darkness</a> (<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/file?h=23661124&amp;i=3076331\" target=\"_blank\">Download 1</a>)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://holdenshearer.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted vs. The Wold of Darkness Companion</a> (<a href=\"https://holdenshearer.files.wordpress.com/2019/02/exalted_vs_world_of_darkness_companion.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Download 2</a>)<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exalted vs World of Darkness Companion, pg 7</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">Were the Wan Xian Dr</span><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">agon</span><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">-</span><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">Blooded</span></b><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><b>?</b></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">I\u2019ve left that deliberately ambiguou</span><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">s. It\u2019s possible </span><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">that the Wan Xian were a few families of Dragon</span><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">-</span><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">Blooded </span><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">that fell into bed with the Yama Kings and were punished </span><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">for their temerity. My personal assumption is th</span><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">at they </span><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">weren\u2019t Dragon</span><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">-</span><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">Bloo</span><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">ded, but were instead some </span><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">undocumented variety of </span><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">Exalted who are now effectively </span><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">extinct. It\u2019s </span><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">also</span><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">possible that they were some sort of latter</span><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">-</span><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">day creation that were similar to the Chosen but not </span><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">identical to them. Ultimately,</span><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">it\u2019s your call. The Dragon</span><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">-</span><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">Blooded themselves don\u2019t really know; even by thei</span><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">r very </span><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">long</span><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">-</span><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">lived standards, all that stuff happened a </span><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">very</span><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">long </span><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">time ago</span></span></div> </div> </div> </div>Please tell me what you think.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kelly Pedersen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1365323-are-the-wan-kuei-still-tied-in-to-exalted-like-they-used-to-be?p=1365331#post1365331\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Certainly, by even 2e times, the whole concept was totally abandoned, and 3e definitely doesn't hold to it at all.</div> </div> </div> </div>Return of the Scarlet Empress (2nd Ed book) dose some leaning into the World of Darkness with one of the possible fates of The Ebon Dragon. Mainly it is suggested that if he becomes a Neverborn he will add more power to the Neverborn and allow them to move.<br /> <br /> This makes them much more like the Neverborn found in Wraith: The Oblivion &amp; other WoD books that depict them. I believe this was a deliberate nod/example of how Exalted's Creation can possibly become the Wolf of Darkness (or more like it), depending on the actions of the PC's &amp; ST.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4428,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4428-daredevil","user":"Daredevil","date":". 02-04-2020, 10:02 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4428-daredevil","name":"Daredevil","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4428_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"404"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-04T18:58:18-08:00","id":1365421,"title":"","content":"Bleh, I think WoD and Exalted are different enough that I kind of don't want any official ties between them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-04T19:09:06-08:00","id":1365423,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kyman201</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1365323-are-the-wan-kuei-still-tied-in-to-exalted-like-they-used-to-be?p=1365421#post1365421\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Bleh, I think WoD and Exalted are different enough that I kind of don't want any official ties between them.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah. It feels very &quot;railroaded&quot; if it is an absolute future for the setting.<br /> <br /> Though I get a great kick out of it being an optional thing, or just a source for inspiration &amp; <i>more material to plunder</i>.<br /> <br /> I loved the little stuff in Return of the Scarlet Empress about how things can get worse &amp; Creation can start looking more &amp; more like the WoD as the Wheel of Ages turns, depending on PC &amp; ST actions. It was all suggestions &amp; idea fodder &amp; good stuff.<br /> <br /> The fan work by Holden hits a similar sweet spot for me.<br /> <br /> I love Exalted <i>can</i> draw inspiration from WoD, but doesn't <i>have to</i>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4428-daredevil","name":"Daredevil","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4428_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"404"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-04T19:14:01-08:00","id":1365425,"title":"","content":"One of the NPC's in the Kindred of the East companion was a surviving Golden child from the second age.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/706-rickayelm","name":"rickayelm","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"76"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-04T19:41:03-08:00","id":1365439,"title":"","content":"Connections between the two got trimmed back to &quot;cheeky in-reference&quot; a long time ago and stayed there, which was why you had Autochthonian Polar Mutants from the Crystal regions referred to as &quot;Glass Walkers&quot;, for example. They have nothing to do with Lunars or Garou, but the apellation is spot on for use in Exalted.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>rickayelm</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1365323-are-the-wan-kuei-still-tied-in-to-exalted-like-they-used-to-be?p=1365425#post1365425\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">One of the NPC's in the Kindred of the East companion was a surviving Golden child from the second age.</div> </div> </div> </div>Completely different second ages and golden children, there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-04T19:42:01-08:00","id":1365440,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4428-daredevil\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar4428_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4428\" data-vbnamecard=\"4428\">Daredevil</a> I like Holden\u2019s personal assumption. Thanks for posting that \ud83d\ude0a.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-04T20:31:46-08:00","id":1365456,"title":"","content":"During the very early development of Exalted, the game line was intended to be the pre-World of Darkness. However well before the game was published, they changed developers. Grabowski came in, rewrote a bunch of ideas and made Exalted its own game that wasn't officially linked to theWorld of Darkness.<br /> <br /> There were still elements and terminology (Malfeans, the whole Underworld, Autochthon, etc.) but those were just fun references and easter eggs rather than indicative of an an official tie.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-05T00:16:40-08:00","id":1365495,"title":"","content":"I would point out that the blurb on the back of 2e talked it being the world's history... but honestly you guys are right.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-05T02:31:42-08:00","id":1365508,"title":"","content":"In terms of Exalted being the past of WoD, or perhaps more accurately / ambiguous a &quot;forking path&quot; of Exalted's world (a path not taken by the Sidereals) being the past of WoD, I get by people wouldn't necessarily be into that, now.<br /> <br /> On the other hand, I do really like the kind of long term dynamism implied by that history, where the Exalted and everything in the world of Exalted can become these almost totally unrecognizable quite different things with thematic connections and there's being either a garbled understanding of true history, or multiple wholescale rewritings of reality since.<br /> <br /> Even if WoD is not taken as the &quot;true future&quot; of Exalted, I like that quality compared to an alternative of sort of, y'know, &quot;Oh, well the nature of the Celestial Exaltations is eternal and immutable, and they will always be around, doing their thing&quot; and the like.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/929-ghosthead","name":"Ghosthead","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2113"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-05T04:41:57-08:00","id":1365518,"title":"","content":"I agree with you about the dynamism.<br /> <br /> I certainly find it interesting to consider the transitionary state between the Second Age of Exalted and the Fourth Age of Earth (which starts after the Bronze Age Collapse).<br /> What comes between Lunars and Fera? Abyssals and Vampires? Dragonblood and Kuei-Jin? Etc.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":2402,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","user":"The Wizard of Oz","date":". 02-05-2020, 08:55 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-05T04:54:01-08:00","id":1365521,"title":"","content":"You can use the connections if you want or not use them if you want. The Exalted vs World of Darkness is a good link to draw connections. I've done some headcanon stuff like the Beast Courts of the Emerald Mother was started as a Pack of Lunars, and the Garou Nation's Western Concordiat was another pack of Lunars (the totems being the Lunars). Revised Get of Fenris Tribebook has some interesting Exaltedy links, basically Fenris very much seemed to be a Strength specialty Lunar, he had a Solar Mate. Wotan was a Solar he didn't like, when he died he seemed to come back all Necromantically Coughabyssalcough.<br /> <br /> But basically Creation doesn't have to become our Earth. If it does it doesn't have to become the World of Darkness, but personally if I were to make it turn into Earth I would make it become the World of Darkness.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kyman201</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1365323-are-the-wan-kuei-still-tied-in-to-exalted-like-they-used-to-be?p=1365421#post1365421\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Bleh, I think WoD and Exalted are different enough that I kind of don't want any official ties between them.</div> </div> </div> </div>Is your sig new? Because that is one of my favorite sigs. :P<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-05T12:26:41-08:00","id":1365589,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1365323-are-the-wan-kuei-still-tied-in-to-exalted-like-they-used-to-be?p=1365521#post1365521\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Is your sig new? Because that is one of my favorite sigs. :P<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Nope. Had it for years","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-05T13:26:14-08:00","id":1365597,"title":"","content":"Exalted being the prehistory of the World of Darkness was more a reference to the kind of ficiton Exalted drew on than much of anything Exalted itself took very seriously. It's as much the real history of the world as Tanith Lee's Flat Eart (before the Earth became bent) or Conan's Hyperboria (After the drowning of Atlantis but before the sons of Arian).<br /> <br /> The very first supplement for Exalted, the 1e STC, even has a textbox saying more or less that it's not really anything important and Exalted might for all we know be a future Age or something ala Book of New Sun or The Dying Earth.<br /> <br /> In the end, the tie to World of Darkness is more htere for Exalted to have a bunch of IP to loot for cool stuff, not realy anything ever important to the setting's core.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-05T13:35:01-08:00","id":1365599,"title":"","content":"*deleted because sufficiently covered*","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-05T14:14:00-08:00","id":1365608,"title":"","content":"Thanks. That\u2019s pretty much what I heard. That Exalted and the World of Darkness are separate worlds and don\u2019t have any official connection.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-05T14:37:07-08:00","id":1365611,"title":"","content":"I mean they can if you want. They both have Motherbog, Authcthonia, the Temple Obscura, Neverborn, Oblivion, Malfeas, the Five Magical Materials, ect...<br /> <br /> If you want the connections are there, but only if you want.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-05T17:27:52-08:00","id":1365631,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Blaque</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1365323-are-the-wan-kuei-still-tied-in-to-exalted-like-they-used-to-be?p=1365597#post1365597\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Exalted being the prehistory of the World of Darkness was more a reference to the kind of ficiton Exalted drew on than much of anything Exalted itself took very seriously. It's as much the real history of the world as Tanith Lee's Flat Eart (before the Earth became bent) or Conan's Hyperboria (After the drowning of Atlantis but before the sons of Arian).<br /> <br /> The very first supplement for Exalted, the 1e STC, even has a textbox saying more or less that it's not really anything important and Exalted might for all we know be a future Age or something ala Book of New Sun or The Dying Earth.<br /> <br /> In the end, the tie to World of Darkness is more htere for Exalted to have a bunch of IP to loot for cool stuff, not realy anything ever important to the setting's core.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Actually, back covers of first edition books start with &quot;Before there was a World of Darkness...,&quot; (at least in the case of the core book and Abyssals) so I'd say that the connection was quite official, even though supported half-heartedly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13416-lanic","name":"Lanic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"194"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-06T01:32:06-08:00","id":1365677,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lanic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1365323-are-the-wan-kuei-still-tied-in-to-exalted-like-they-used-to-be?p=1365631#post1365631\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Actually, back covers of first edition books start with &quot;Before there was a World of Darkness...,&quot; (at least in the case of the core book and Abyssals) so I'd say that the connection was quite official, even though supported half-heartedly.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sure, but again, it has about as much &quot;seriousness&quot; or commitment to it as Robert E. Howard was trying to tell a for-sure history of Earth when writing about Hyperborea.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}